  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Task-manager metrics: GetAllProcesses() with executable path, command line, user, parent PID, start time, state, priority, CPU time, and disk I/O per process; per-core CPU, memory total/used, swap, disk bytes/sec, per-interface network throughput, volumes, load averages, and SystemInfo; cross-platform ProcessActions (kill, kill tree, priority, suspend, resume); PERFSTATS_HOST_ROOT for containerized Linux agents. See CHANGELOG.md.",
